  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Urban Innovation Project, through Boston Consulting Group, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for the Indian Ministry of Housing and Urban Affairs to develop its national Smart Cities infrastructure through the National Urban Innovation Project. The assistance will study a package of digital platforms and institutions intended to spur domestic innovation, enhance data-driven governance, and develop human capital in order to solve Indias urban challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
